// profile: step=one
// A join that persists (<=): a buyer and a seller trade when the guard finds
// their prices equal and no halt present.  The market's open flag is read
// (<<-), not taken.  A receive here may mix the modes, each bind taking or
// reading its own row; f1r3lang gives every bind the mode of the first.
open!(market) |
buy!(alice, 3) | sell!(bob, 3) | sell!(carol, 4) |
for ($b, $p <= buy & $s, $q <= sell & $m <<- open where $p == $q and absent(halt!())) {
  trade!($b, $s, $p)
}
